<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1 class="main-title">0-12月猫咪成长手册</h1>
        <div class="search-tag"><span>🔎</span> | 草莓是只喵</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">8-9月龄</h2>
        <div class="section-card">
            <div class="content-flex">
                <div class="left-col">
                    <div class="subtitle">成长事项：</div>
                    <div class="list-text">
                        <p>①猫咪每天会花大量时间去舔毛，毛发吃进肚子是难免的事。若体内积累了大量毛发还会引发毛球症</p>
                        <p>②可以试着自己种猫草（小麦种子）性价比高。如果猫咪不吃可以换成猫草片，比化毛膏健康的</p>
                        <p>③家中如果种了花花草草，那要仔细查一下对猫咪是不是有毒</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="image-row">
                        <div class="image-item">
                            <div class="placeholder ph-cat-grass">[Photo: Cat grass in white pot]</div>
                            <div class="caption">猫草</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="image-item">
                            <div class="placeholder ph-cat-grass-tabs">[Photo: Bottle of cat grass tablets]</div>
                            <div class="caption">猫草片</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="right-col">
                    <div class="placeholder img-pills">[Photo: Tablets in a tin]</div>
                    <div class="note-paper">
                        <div class="tape tape-1"></div>
                        <p><strong>对猫咪有毒的植物：</strong><br>百合、杜鹃、绿萝、雏菊、洋甘菊、大丽花、水仙、夹竹桃、绣球花、鸢尾花、郁金香、虎皮兰、君子兰、秋水仙、芦荟、富贵竹、铃兰</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">9-10月龄</h2>
        <div class="section-card">
            <div class="content-flex">
                <div class="left-col">
                    <div class="subtitle">成长事项：</div>
                    <div class="list-text">
                        <p>①需要保证猫咪的饮水量，如果猫咪不喜欢喝水可以买一个饮水机试试</p>
                        <p>②给猫咪丰富的空间，保持心情的愉悦，可以每天花20分钟跟猫咪互动，增进感情</p>
                        <p>③注意纠正猫咪的不良行为，如咬人等</p>
                        <p>④多让猫咪运动，并且控制好体重</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="image-row">
                        <div class="image-item">
                            <div class="placeholder ph-water-dispenser">[Photo: White pet water dispenser]</div>
                            <div class="caption">宠物饮水机</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="image-item">
                            <div class="placeholder ph-teaser-wand">[Photo: Feather cat teaser wand]</div>
                            <div class="caption">逗猫棒</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="right-col">
                    <div class="placeholder img-cat-play">[Photo: Kitten playing with teaser wand]</div>
                    <div class="note-paper">
                        <div class="tape tape-2"></div>
                        <p><strong>猫咪不喜欢喝水的原因：</strong><br>猫咪的祖先是生活在沙漠地带，基因问题导致猫咪渴觉不敏感。<br>但是不代表猫咪对水需求不高，反之猫咪喝水少容易导致泌尿方面的疾病，所以要多喝水</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

